WEBVTT

00:56:29.235 --> 00:56:33.798
So what does that leave me
in terms of what I now get to be?

00:56:33.822 --> 00:56:37.869
OK, well, now I'm a person and there's
no one in the world I can't live without.

00:56:37.893 --> 00:56:40.078
That's very freeing.

00:56:40.102 --> 00:56:42.198
Where can I go? What can I explore?

00:56:42.222 --> 00:56:45.713
What worlds can I move in now?
What freedom can that bring me?

00:56:45.737 --> 00:56:47.365
And how can I do that

00:56:47.389 --> 00:56:51.189
without sacrificing one bit
of the love and devotion and passion

00:56:51.213 --> 00:56:54.710
that I had with this one
completely irreplaceable human being?

00:56:54.734 --> 00:56:57.271
So I got to have that.

00:56:57.295 --> 00:56:59.347
I didn't want it to end the way it ended,

00:56:59.371 --> 00:57:01.117
but it wasn't up to me.